          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.8.1+MAT.8.2+MAT.8.3+MAT.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 8:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.40+MRK.1.41+MRK.1.42+MRK.1.43+MRK.1.44+MRK.1.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 1:40-45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire ari omuri tauni emwe ahari ezo, haija omushaija oshwekirwe ebibembe; ku yaareebire Yesu, yaajuumara, yaamweshengyereza ati: Mukama wangye, ku oraabe nookunda, noobaasa kunshemeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaagorora omukono, yaamukoraho, naagira ati: Ninkunda; shemera. Ahonaaho ebibembe byamurugaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.15.2+LEV.15.3+LEV.15.4+LEV.15.5+LEV.15.6+LEV.15.7+LEV.15.8+LEV.15.9+LEV.15.10+LEV.15.11+LEV.15.12+LEV.15.13+LEV.15.14+LEV.15.15+LEV.15.16+LEV.15.17+LEV.15.18+LEV.15.19+LEV.15.20+LEV.15.21+LEV.15.22+LEV.15.23+LEV.15.24+LEV.15.25+LEV.15.26+LEV.15.27+LEV.15.28+LEV.15.29+LEV.15.30+LEV.15.31+LEV.15.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 15:2-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamwehenangiriza kutagira ou yaakigambira, ati: Kwonka irooko ogyende oyeyorekye aha munyamurwa, ohongye empongano ahabw'okushemezibwa kwawe, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire, kibe eky'okuhamya omu maisho g'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka okurangaanwa kwe kwayeyongyera okukiraho kubuga hoona; n'emitwe mingi y'abantu yaateerana kuhurira n'okutambirwa endwara zaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 1:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka We yaarugayo, yaaza omu ihamba, yaashaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
